 "description": "ImportCapTable writes a whole cap table in one call and one transaction: every row lands or none does, a row naming an existing holder is added to them (and reported as reused), a round the file names is recorded as closed history, and the result is refused if it would break the cap table's rules or does not match the totals the founder confirmed. Use this for any import of more than one holding instead of a sequence of single writes.",
